% INVALID certificate: max x, x in [0,10] integer, has optimum 10. With the solution x = 5, the cutoff OBJ <= 5
% is not a cutoff for maximization (it removes the better solutions) but the upper bound 5 to prove itself.
VER 1.1
VAR 1
x
INT 1
0
OBJ max
1 0 1
CON 2 0
C1 G 0 1 0 1
C2 L 10 1 0 1
RTP range -inf 5
SOL 1
s1 1 0 5
DER 1
D1 L 5 OBJ { sol } -1
